## ItemsApi

### List currencies
## List currencies
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/currency/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json

### Get currency
## Get currency
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/currency/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json

### List item attributes
## List item attributes
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/item-attribute/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json

### Get item attribute
## Get item attribute
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/item-attribute/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json

